      "token_end_exclusive": 723
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 192230,
      "end_ms": 193070,
      "text": "也不爱出门，",
      "token_start": 723,
      "token_end_exclusive": 728
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 193290,
      "end_ms": 194505,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交，",
      "token_start": 728,
      "token_end_exclusive": 734
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 194820,
      "end_ms": 196060,
      "text": "你就每天看两页，",
      "token_start": 734,
      "token_end_exclusive": 741
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 196220,
      "end_ms": 197635,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，",
      "token_start": 741,
      "token_end_exclusive": 749
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 197980,
      "end_ms": 201520,
      "text": "你也会变成一个会说话的人我当时听见这句话的时候，",
      "token_start": 749,
      "token_end_exclusive": 772
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 201520,
      "end_ms": 202725,
      "text": "我的眼泪就出来了。",
      "token_start": 772,
      "token_end_exclusive": 780
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 202900,
      "end_ms": 204540,
      "text": "他写的是别人夸你优秀，",
      "token_start": 780,
      "token_end_exclusive": 790
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 204660,
      "end_ms": 205200,
      "text": "你就回，",
      "token_start": 790,
      "token_end_exclusive": 793
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 205320,
      "end_ms": 206600,
      "text": "那是不优秀点，",
      "token_start": 793,
      "token_end_exclusive": 799
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 206600,
      "end_ms": 207915,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友？",
      "token_start": 799,
      "token_end_exclusive": 807
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 208210,
      "end_ms": 209135,
      "text": "你看很有味道，",
      "token_start": 807,
      "token_end_exclusive": 813
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 209570,
      "end_ms": 210570,
      "text": "假如不爱说话，",
      "token_start": 813,
      "token_end_exclusive": 819
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 210730,
      "end_ms": 211595,
      "text": "不爱争辩，",
      "token_start": 819,
      "token_end_exclusive": 823
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 211840,
      "end_ms": 212645,
      "text": "也不爱出门，",
      "token_start": 823,
      "token_end_exclusive": 828
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 212940,
      "end_ms": 214045,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交。",
      "token_start": 828,
      "token_end_exclusive": 834
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 214350,
      "end_ms": 215530,
      "text": "你每天就看两页，",
      "token_start": 834,
      "token_end_exclusive": 841
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 215650,
      "end_ms": 216950,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，",
      "token_start": 841,
      "token_end_exclusive": 849
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 217010,
      "end_ms": 219770,
      "text": "你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。",
      "token_start": 849,
      "token_end_exclusive": 864
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 219850,
      "end_ms": 220090,
      "text": "哇，",
      "token_start": 864,
      "token_end_exclusive": 865
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 220090,
      "end_ms": 221225,
      "text": "这真是太棒了。",
      "token_start": 865,
      "token_end_exclusive": 871
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 221620,
      "end_ms": 222300,
      "text": "在这本书里，",
      "token_start": 871,
      "token_end_exclusive": 876
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 222300,
      "end_ms": 223455,
      "text": "有句话我特别欣赏。",
      "token_start": 876,
      "token_end_exclusive": 884
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 223630,
      "end_ms": 223970,
      "text": "他说，",
      "token_start": 884,
      "token_end_exclusive": 886
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 224090,
      "end_ms": 225510,
      "text": "有人嘲讽你眼睛小，",
      "token_start": 886,
      "token_end_exclusive": 894
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 225650,
      "end_ms": 226590,
      "text": "高情商回答，",
      "token_start": 894,
      "token_end_exclusive": 899
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 226630,
      "end_ms": 227830,
      "text": "万物皆有裂痕，",
      "token_start": 899,
      "token_end_exclusive": 905
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 227970,
      "end_ms": 229455,
      "text": "那是光照进来的地方。",
      "token_start": 905,
      "token_end_exclusive": 914
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 229730,
      "end_ms": 229910,
      "text": "哇，",
      "token_start": 914,
      "token_end_exclusive": 915
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 229910,
      "end_ms": 231090,
      "text": "这真是太棒了，",
      "token_start": 915,
      "token_end_exclusive": 921
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 231150,
      "end_ms": 232490,
      "text": "每一句都很有意思，",
      "token_start": 921,
      "token_end_exclusive": 929
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 232570,
      "end_ms": 233110,
      "text": "随便翻，",
      "token_start": 929,
      "token_end_exclusive": 932
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 233110,
      "end_ms": 233490,
      "text": "对吧？",
      "token_start": 932,
      "token_end_exclusive": 934
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 233490,
      "end_ms": 233670,
      "text": "哇，",
      "token_start": 934,
      "token_end_exclusive": 935
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 233670,
      "end_ms": 234805,
      "text": "这句话太好了，",
      "token_start": 935,
      "token_end_exclusive": 941
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 235000,
      "end_ms": 237180,
      "text": "他写的是别人问你一个月工资多少，",
      "token_start": 941,
      "token_end_exclusive": 956
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 237260,
      "end_ms": 238900,
      "text": "你就会比以前好多了。",
      "token_start": 956,
      "token_end_exclusive": 965
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 238940,
      "end_ms": 240855,
      "text": "现在吃泡面敢放两根肠了。",
      "token_start": 965,
      "token_end_exclusive": 976
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 241050,
      "end_ms": 242170,
      "text": "我读到这段的时候，",
      "token_start": 976,
      "token_end_exclusive": 984
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 242230,
      "end_ms": 244090,
      "text": "这真是让我欲解心开啊，",
      "token_start": 984,
      "token_end_exclusive": 994
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 244250,
      "end_ms": 246370,
      "text": "这本书就像是个社交宝典，",
      "token_start": 994,
      "token_end_exclusive": 1005
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 246370,
      "end_ms": 249590,
      "text": "把各种社交场景都变成了问题加答案的形式。",
      "token_start": 1005,
      "token_end_exclusive": 1024
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 249730,
      "end_ms": 252230,
      "text": "你说哪家的书架上不应该有一本这个书，",
      "token_start": 1024,
      "token_end_exclusive": 1041
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 252410,
      "end_ms": 256310,
      "text": "就是手把手教我们不同的场景之下应该怎么说？",
      "token_start": 1041,
      "token_end_exclusive": 1061
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 256510,
      "end_ms": 259310,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，",
      "token_start": 1061,
      "token_end_exclusive": 1079
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 259310,
      "end_ms": 260550,
      "text": "你就放心拿回去看，",
      "token_start": 1079,
      "token_end_exclusive": 1087
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 260570,
      "end_ms": 261950,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你，",
      "token_start": 1087,
      "token_end_exclusive": 1096
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 261950,
      "end_ms": 264430,
      "text": "这是我近几年来讲过的最简单的一本书。",
      "token_start": 1096,
      "token_end_exclusive": 1113
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 264570,
      "end_ms": 266290,
      "text": "我觉得这个书适合所有人，",
      "token_start": 1113,
      "token_end_exclusive": 1124
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 266350,
      "end_ms": 269110,
      "text": "让你不管在任何场合都能够轻松拿捏。",
      "token_start": 1124,
      "token_end_exclusive": 1140
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 269190,
      "end_ms": 270425,
      "text": "所以强烈推荐。",
      "token_start": 1140,
      "token_end_exclusive": 1146
    }
